INSIGHT: RAVE, the native token of RaveDAO, has surged more than 6,000% over the past month, briefly entering the top 50 cryptocurrencies after a move from roughly $0.25 to above $14.

The project positions itself as a Web3 music protocol tied to EDM culture, focusing on on-chain ticketing, crypto payments at live events, and staking linked to “rave revenues,” alongside claimed partnerships with major exchanges including Binance and OKX.

@HeleneBraunn reports
